      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Every third attack or damaging spell on the same target deals bonus magic damage, and grants Ekko a burst of speed if the target is a champion.",
      "summary_zh": "每当艾克对相同目标施放第三次普攻或伤害性技能时，都会造成额外魔法伤害，并且如果目标是英雄，那么艾克还会获得爆发性的移动速度加成。",
